iv class=\"gallerytext\">向山行政暨遊客中心</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 235px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 180px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Taoyuan_International_Airport,_Taiwan_(8336946440).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"桃園國際機場第一航廈\"><img alt=\"桃園國際機場第一航廈\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Taoyuan_International_Airport%2C_Taiwan_%288336946440%29.jpg/250px-Taoyuan_International_Airport%2C_Taiwan_%288336946440%29.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"133\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Taoyuan_International_Airport%2C_Taiwan_%288336946440%29.jpg/500px-Taoyuan_International_Airport%2C_Taiwan_%288336946440%29.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1800\" data-file-height=\"1200\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">桃園國際機場第一航廈</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"家族\"><span id=\".E5.AE.B6.E6.97.8F\"></span>家族</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%9C%98%E7%B4%80%E5%BD%A5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：家族\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>團紀彥的父親為<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BD%9C%E6%9B%B2%E5%AE%B6\" title=\"作曲家\">作曲家</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9C%98%E4%BC%8A%E7%8E%96%E7%A3%A8\" title=\"團伊玖磨\">團伊玖磨</a>，生前與華人友好，曾多次率團到中國與台灣演出，2001年率團於<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%98%87%E5%B7%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"蘇州\">蘇州</a>演出時病逝。叔父為<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E5%AE%B6\" title=\"生物學家\">生物學家</a><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"團勝磨\" data-lang-code=\"ja\" data-lang-name=\"日语\" data-foreign-title=\"團勝磨\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%9C%98%E5%8B%9D%E7%A3%A8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"團勝磨（頁面不存在）\">團勝磨</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">日語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%98%E5%8B%9D%E7%A3%A8\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"ja:團勝磨\"><span lang=\"ja\" dir=\"auto\">團勝磨</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>。祖父<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"團伊能\" data-lang-code=\"ja\" data-lang-name=\"日语\" data-foreign-title=\"團伊能\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%9C%98%E4%BC%8A%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"團伊能（頁面不存在）\">團伊能</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">日語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%98%E4%BC%8A%E8%83%BD\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"ja:團伊能\"><span lang=\"ja\" dir=\"auto\">團伊能</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>曾任<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%8F%83%E8%AD%B0%E9%99%A2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"日本參議院\">日本參議院</a>議員。曾祖父<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9B%A2%E7%90%A2%E7%A3%A8\" title=\"團琢磨\">團琢磨</a>為企業家，曾任<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%95%E5%90%88%E5%90%8D%E6%9C%83%E7%A4%BE\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"三井合名會社\">三井合名會社</a>的理事長，並在1928年受封為<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%B7%E7%88%B5\" title=\"男爵\">男爵</a>，但於1932年<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"血盟團事件\" data-lang-code=\"ja\" data-lang-name=\"日语\" data-foreign-title=\"血盟団事件\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%A1%80%E7%9B%9F%E5%9C%98%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"血盟團事件（頁面不存在）\">血盟團事件</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">日語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A1%80%E7%9B%9F%E5%9B%A3%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"ja:血盟団事件\"><span lang=\"ja\" dir=\"auto\">血盟団事件</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>中遭暗殺。女兒<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"團遙香\" data-lang-code=\"ja\" data-lang-name=\"日语\" data-foreign-title=\"團遥香\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%9C%98%E9%81%99%E9%A6%99&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"團遙香（頁面不存在）\">團遙香</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">日語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%98%E9%81%A5%E9%A6%99\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"ja:團遙香\"><span lang=\"ja\" dir=\"auto\">團遥香</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>為<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%97%9D%E4%BA%BA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"藝人\">藝人</a>。同父異母胞兄<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%9C%98%E5%90%8D%E4%BF%9D%E7%B4%80&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"團名保紀（頁面不存在）\">團名保紀</a>為西洋美術史學者及群馬大學教授。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考資料\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E8.B3.87.E6.96.99\"></span>參考資料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%9C%98%E7%B4%80%E5%BD%A5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"編輯章節：參考資料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-col